# build artifact from `go build ./...`
/callscape-dump

# where `make dump` found the module it dumped: a path on this machine only
/web/.source-root

# whatever `make dump` or `make sample` last wrote, module-sized and different
# every time. Nothing is committed in its place: a graph is derived, and making
# one takes seconds.
/web/public/graph.json

# the Codespace's background clone-and-dump, kept out of the terminal Vite is
# writing to. Whether the graph arrived is a question for the page, not a log.
/.devcontainer/sample.log

# where you were looking last: scratch, rewritten a dozen times a session.
# `make cue` writes a starting one when it is missing.
/web/cue.json

# Owner avatars for the marks in the sky. Somebody else's artwork — the GitHub
# Octocat among it — so this repo does not redistribute any of it. Drop your
# own in and they appear; with none, the sky is empty and the log says which
# file it looked for.
/web/public/badges/

.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor scratch. Belongs in a global ignore, and is here as well because this
# repo has already committed a vim swapfile once.
[._]*.sw[a-p]
[._]*.un~
*~
